:tab_container
	ECG :tab
		ECG performed :yes_no  {condition_test=Y,condition_action=show,condition_target=ecg_concept}
		$ecg_concept :concept_group {concept_type=blness:ecg,indent=1}

	CXR :tab
		CXR performed :yes_no {condition_test=Y,condition_action=show,condition_target=cxr_concept}
		$cxr_concept :concept_group {concept_type=blness:cxr,indent=1}

	Echocardiogram :tab
		Echo test performed :yes_no $echo_test_performed {condition_test=Y,condition_action=show,condition_target=echo_data}

		$echo_data :container {indent=1}
			Date of echo :date $date_of_echo
			Ejection fraction :number $echo_ef {suffix=%}

	Oscillometry :tab
		$oscil_concept :concept_group {concept_type=blness:oscillometry}

	-Acute disease severity :tab
	-	DECAF score $decaf_score :radio_buttons {dictionary=decaf_score,inline=1,ajax-func=DECAFCalculate}
-Extended MRC score* $mrc_admission :radio_buttons {dictionary=mrc_grade,value_only=1,inline=1,condition_test=5,condition_action=show,condition_target=mrc_admiss_ext}
-* $mrc_admiss_ext :radio_buttons {dictionary=mrc_extended,inline=1}
-$vis_analog_score
-$exact_pro_score
-LV function $lv_function :yes_no
-RV function $rv_function :yes_no
-Valvular function $valvular_function :yes_no
-LV wall thickness $lv_wall_thickness :number
-e/e on tissue Doppler :number